本書逐段研讀啟示錄全書二十二章，以漸進啟示的終點為視角，整合老弟兄查經教導法、John MacArthur 逐節解經講道（gty.org）、以及 G.K. Beale、Robert Mounce、Grant Osborne 等當代學者的解經洞見。全書貫穿透視人性、出路何在、神的計劃、宇宙爭戰四大主題，從榮耀基督的異象、七教會的呼召，經過印、號、碗的審判，直到巴比倫傾覆、基督再來、千年國度，終於新天新地與新耶路撒冷。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ chapter-by-chapter study of all twenty-two chapters of Revelation, read as the culmination of progressive revelation, integrating Elder Wong's Bible teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition (gty.org), and the exegetical insight of G.K. Beale, Robert Mounce, and Grant Osborne --- witnessing the completion of God's eternal plan and the final consummation of faith, hope, and love at the marriage supper of the Lamb.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

